course: dictionary
lesson: 13184
title: Fri: the short form of Friday
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Fri is a short way of writing Friday. Short words like this save space on timetables, calendars and shop signs, where there is little room.
explain: Friday is the day after Thursday and before Saturday. In «The library is open Mon–Fri», the dash means "to", so Mon–Fri means Monday to Friday, the school or work week.
explain: Fri and Fri. are both correct, and they mean the same thing. The capital F shows that it is the name of a day.
fact: Fri is an abbreviation, which is a short form of a longer word.
fact: Fri and Fri. both mean Friday.
fact: «Mon–Fri» means Monday to Friday.
fact: Friday comes after Thursday and before Saturday.
fact: Day names always start with a capital letter, so Fri does too.
exercise: «The shop is open Mon–Fri.» Which day comes after Thursday, shown as Fri? | Wednesday | Saturday | Sunday | *Friday
exercise: In a timetable, «Art: Fri, 2 pm» means Art is on which day? | Sunday | Tuesday | Monday | *Friday
exercise: Ella says, «Fri night is my favourite.» What does Fri stand for? | Frost | Fresh | Fry | *Friday
test: «The bus runs Mon–Fri, not at weekends.» Which days does the bus run? | Saturday and Sunday | *Monday to Friday | Every day of the week | Thursday only
test: In a diary, which short word means Friday? | Frost | Fry | *Fri | Fire
exam: «The library is open Mon–Fri.» Which days is it open? | *Monday to Friday | Thursday to Sunday | Tuesday only | Saturday and Sunday
